## 📡 API Endpoints

### 👤 Admin Email Templates Management

| Method | Endpoint                                | Description                                               |
|--------|-----------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| GET    | /api/admin/email-templates              | Retrieve all email templates                               |
| POST   | /api/admin/email-templates              | Create a new email template                                |
| GET    | /api/admin/email-templates/{id}         | Retrieve a specific email template by ID                   |
| PUT    | /api/admin/email-templates/{id}         | Update an existing email template                           |
| DELETE | /api/admin/email-templates/{id}         | Delete a specific email template                           |

### 👤 User Email Sending (Triggered Events)

| Method | Endpoint                                | Description                                               |
|--------|-----------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| POST   | /api/user/send-email                   | Send a specific email template to the user (use template ID) |

### 👤 Preview Email Template

| Method | Endpoint                                | Description                                               |
|--------|-----------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| GET    | /api/admin/email-templates/{id}/preview | Preview a specific email template (for testing purposes)  |

### 👤 Email Template Logs

| Method | Endpoint                                | Description                                               |
|--------|-----------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| GET    | /api/admin/email-template-logs          | Retrieve logs of sent emails                               |
| GET    | /api/admin/email-template-logs/{id}     | Retrieve specific email template log by ID                 |

---

## 📌 Notes

- **Email Templates** can contain dynamic variables that are replaced with actual values when an email is sent (e.g., `{{user_name}}`).
- The **Email Template Logs** table is used to track email send status, providing an audit trail of sent emails and any errors encountered during sending.
- The API allows for both admin management of templates (creating, editing, deleting) and triggering the sending of emails via event-driven actions (e.g., user registration, password reset).
- The **preview** endpoint helps admins test the email templates before they are used in production, ensuring they render correctly.

